    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMosi nawawakulumpi awaIsarela ayilejeli antu, nawu, Kahembenu kuleja kwejima kunayileji lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dimwakela munazambuki dehi Yodana, muneŋili dehi mwituŋa dikuyinka Yehova Nzambi yeyi, wakemiki malola amaneni, wakayisoti nasamendi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wunazambuki dehi wakasonekapahu mazu ejima anshimbiji; kulonda wakeŋa ili mwituŋa dikukwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi, ituŋa datuloŋa twamayeli nawuchi, mwomwakaniniyi Yehova Nzambi yawankakulula jeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himwakela munazambuki dehi Yodana, mwakemiki malolawa inukuyileja lelu hampidi yaEbali, wakayisoti nasamendi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanamutuŋiluku Yehova Nzambi yeyi kameŋa, kameŋa kamalola; kutapaku chuma chachikuŋu chinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kameŋa kaYehova Nzambi yeyi wakatuŋi kamalola amukuma; wakamulambwilu huYehova Nzambi yeyi nyilambu yakushita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakaketwilaŋa kuyimuna yanyilambu yakuwunda, hiwakadiila kwenoku; hiwakazaŋalala kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamalolowu wakasonekuhu mazu ejima anshimbiji chalumbuluka nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMosi nawatupristu aLevi ahosheli nawaIsarela ejima, nawu, EyiIsarela, mwenakuzo, wutiyilili; lelu wunekali dehi muza waYehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, kovwahili izu daYehova Nzambi yeyi, nimwanakulejiyinimuyidika yindi yinukukuleja lelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi walejeli antu dena ifuku odu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Tiyenu, antu akemana hampidi yaGerizimi nakukisula antu, himwakela munazambuki dehi Yodana aSimeyona, naLevi, naYuda, naIsakari, naYosefu, naBenjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akemanahampidi yaEbali nakushiŋana; aRubeni, naGadi, naAsheri, naZebuluni, naDani, naNafwatali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALevi akahosha akayila amayala aIsarela ejima nezu dakaŋuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
