        {
          "text": "Wukukama namuhelindi, hela himwana katata yindi, hela himwana kamama yindi, amushiŋi. Antu ejima akela nawu, Mwomwenomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.22",
